        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "The plaintiff commenced this action to recover damages for personal injuries that she allegedly sustained on the morning of June 21, 2016, when she slipped and fell on liquid on one of the steps of a staircase in the defendants' building in Brooklyn.",
