        "evidence_id": "E007",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Here, the defendants failed to establish, prima facie, when they last cleaned or inspected the subject stairwell relative to the time of the plaintiff's accident and, therefore, they failed to establish, prima facie, that they did not have constructive notice of the alleged hazardous condition",
